<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ffea2f4\" data-id=\"ffea2f4\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa2e48f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fa2e48f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam Capital Limited (Cayman Islands) is our parent company. Cayman Islands registration is tax efficient and gives us favourable counterparty jurisdiction status. Arqaam Capital Limited (Cayman Islands) is a pure holding company; it does not conduct any business itself and does not enter into transactional activities. It has established direct or indirect subsidiaries through which it conducts business; it provides funding and assistance for its subsidiaries; and it sets the strategy for and oversees the Arqaam Group.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7816663 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7816663\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bf4bd9c\" data-id=\"bf4bd9c\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c36a560 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c36a560\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tArqaam Group Central Support\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f8207f0\" data-id=\"f8207f0\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-86831e6 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"86831e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam Group Central Support Services Limited (Dubia International Financial Center), provides management and support services across the Arqaam Group.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5ed63e7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5ed63e7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6d2a7f8\" data-id=\"6d2a7f8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d99f93d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d99f93d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam Global Markets Limited\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-295ecb3\" data-id=\"295ecb3\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dbe82e5 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dbe82e5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam Global Markets Limited (Cayman Islands) is the holding company for our Arqaam Global Markets financial services business. It does not conduct business itself, except through its subsidiaries. Its key operating subsidiaries are:<\/p>\n<p>Arqaam Capital Limited (Dubai International Financial Center) which is authorised and regulated by the Dubai Financial Services Authority<\/p>\n<p>Arqaam Securities LLC (United Arab Emirates) which is authorised and regulated by the UAE&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);\">Capital Market Authority<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Arqaam Capital Financial Company (Kingdom of Saudi Arabia) which is authorised and regulated by the KSA Capital Markets Authority<\/p>\n<p>Arqaam Securities Brokerage, S. A.E. (Egypt); Arqaam Capital for Promoting, Underwriting and Financial Advisory of Financial Securities, S.A.E. (Egypt); and Arqaam Capital Egypt Holdings for Financial Investments, S.A.E. (Egypt); each of which is authorised and regulated by the Egyptian Financial Regulatory Authority<\/p>\n<p>Arqaam Capital Research Offshore s.a.l. (Lebanon) which assists with drafting research<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6e457a9 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6e457a9\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e296b0e\" data-id=\"e296b0e\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7b7d69 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c7b7d69\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam Capital Principal Finance Limited\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-11b3886\" data-id=\"11b3886\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f921c9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9f921c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam Capital Principal Finance Limited (Cayman Islands) is the holding company for our Arqaam Investment Partners alternative investments business.\u00a0 It does not conduct business itself, except through its subsidiaries.\u00a0 Its key subsidiaries are:<\/p><p>Brizenica Bay Investors Limited (Cayman Islands) and related entities for Project Dalmatia \u2013 a project to develop, manage and operate a luxury hotel and residences at Brizenica Bay, Hvar, Croatia<\/p><p>Arqaam Gold Mine Investors Limited (Cayman Islands) for Project Mongold \u2013 a project with an attractive gold mining platform in Mongolia and now in the process of expanding into Kazakhstan<\/p><p>Arqaam Agriculture Investors Limited (Cayman Islands) for Project Harvest \u2013 a project with Agripower, an Australian company that mines and processes silica-rich fresh water diatomaceous earth<\/p><p>Arqaam Travel Investors Limited (Cayman Islands) for Project Travel \u2013 a project with Wego, a Singaporean company with a leading on-line travel business with significant downloads and a travel metasearch engine to compare flight and hotel prices online<\/p><p>Arqaam Logistics Investors Limited (Cayman Islands) for Project Bolt \u2013 a project with Quiqup, a UK Entity with a MENA based and technology focused last-mile deliver and logistics business<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9e5faec elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"9e5faec\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-34514a5\" data-id=\"34514a5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64e85f9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"64e85f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNew Initiatives\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e34f816\" data-id=\"e34f816\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b373b9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4b373b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam Wealth<span class=\"x_1716604717apple-converted-space\"><b>&nbsp;<\/b><\/span>\u2013 With strong regional content through deep rooted presence in MENA and an in-depth research capabilities, Arqaam can offer differentiated products and services management business. The platform provides enhanced client experience through integrated wealth management platform and single point of contact for convenience and efficiency.<\/p>\n<p>Arqaam Digital<b>&nbsp;<\/b>\u2013 Arqaam pivoting into Syndicate Strategy addresses large funding gaps in the industry for technology start ups and will allow Arqaam to become the Advisor of choice to build future revenue streams like IB. Foray into fintech allows Arqaam to capture new market share and revenues streams through digitalization of financial products.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>CORPORATE STRUCTURE Investor Relations \/ Corporate Structure ARQAAM CAPITAL LIMITED(Cayman)Arqaam Group parent company ARQAAM GROUP CENTRAL SUPPORT SERVICES LIMITED(DIFC)Providing management and support services across the Arqaam Group ARQAAM GLOBAL MARKETS ResearchSales &amp; Trading\u00a0Asset ManagementInvestment Banking\u00a0Treasury &amp; Custody ARQAAM PRINCIPAL FINANCE Special SituationsTechnology InvestmentsSyndicated Investments NEW INITIATIVES Arqaam WealthArqaam Digital Arqaam Capital Limited (Cayman Islands) Arqaam [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-full-width.php","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18730","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Corporate Structure - Arqaam<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.arqaamcapital.com\/corporate-structure\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Corporate Structure - Arqaam\" \/>\n<meta 